{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtest open now! </strong><br>Help shape the game by taking part in our playtest! Avaliable now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Entity is a threat, keep it distracted</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1745257041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Entity adapts to how you play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/Timeout.gif?t=1745257041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offering you different upgrades and abilities, as well as adapting its own attacks, based on what you do during the game. Try mixing up your playstyle to discover new abilities! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Entity wants what's best for both of you<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/Choices.gif?t=1745257041\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make the choice between multiple powers, and grow stronger with each attempt!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Entity is full of potential</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/extras/Discoveries.gif?t=1745257041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover New Attacks, Combos, Evolutions and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Entity will not be stopped</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are only stalling for time. It will never be enough.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3292750?t=1745257041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3292750?t=1745257041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292750/d6385dbb2bbadd0546c7f0ee44ab5ea48db76b3a/caps